# Style Guidelines
Overall vibe: playful, whimsical, and comforting—like bedtime storybooks with a modern twist.

## Primary palette:
 - BrightPink #F45B69 → call‑to‑action elements (choice buttons, emoji hover).
 - Almond #F1DAC4 → main background for maximum contrast and clean look.
 - Black #000000 → text/body copy. Keep large headings at 90% opacity for softer feel.

Shapes: 16 px rounded corners on cards & buttons; pill‑shaped option buttons.
Imagery: GPT‑4o images should lean pastel with subtle Verdigris or Pink accents. Avoid harsh shadows.
Spacing: generous padding (p‑4 min) and 24 px line‑height for readability.



Motion: 150 ms ease‑in‑out fade on scene transitions; slide‑in for new images.